# BrainiFamily app

## Rutas

- Login único: `/brainifamily/login`.
- Paneles: `/brainifamily/admin` · `/brainifamily/director` · `/brainifamily/teacher` · `/brainifamily/home` (padre).
- Invites: `/brainifamily/invite/{director,teacher,parent}`.
- Redirects legacy (`/login`, `/home`, `/signup`, …) → `/brainifamily/*` en `@src/app/router.tsx`.

## Guards

- `@src/shared/components/navigation/AdminRoute.tsx`
- `@src/shared/components/navigation/DirectorRoute.tsx`
- `@src/shared/components/navigation/TeacherRoute.tsx`
- `@src/shared/components/navigation/ProtectedRoute.tsx` (padre / app autenticada)

Tras login, enrutar por rol (`get_my_role()`): super_admin → admin; director → director; teacher → teacher; parent → onboarding o home.

## Dominio UI

- Invite-only: no formularios de signup ni waitlist.
- El menor no tiene cuenta; progreso vía padre (`CurrentChildProvider`).
- Catálogo pedagógico (`missions` / `activities` / `medals`): solo lectura en la app.
- Teacher/director: progreso en solo lectura; escritura de progreso = padre.
- Landings Kids/Juniors son placeholders; no construir producto ahí sin petición explícita.
